paragraphs:
While grief suffocated the disciples,
while fear locked doors,
while confusion spread everywhere,
Mary Magdalene showed up again.

The Hebrew word used is:
וַיַּכִּרֵם — vayyakkirem
from the root נכר (nakar)

The phrase לְמִחְיָה (lemichyah) means:
for revival,
for life-preservation,
for sustaining life.

“He was oppressed and afflicted,
yet He opened not His mouth;
like a lamb led to the slaughter…”

ἀγαπᾷς με;
agapas me?
“Do you love Me?” (divine, sacrificial love)

The enemy discovered something terrifying:
if you can control someone emotionally,
you no longer need to overpower them physically.
